  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1781611927_3863670_be20af2d145a87aa07ad15bcebe1b89b.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-indent:0px;\">Spoiler Golf<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> is a different golf company.  We think different, market different, and build different putters.</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0px;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">Our putters are</span> precision-engineered and designed to help golfers see the truth in every putt. Our patented Lead Edge Roll face technology creates earlier, purer forward roll, reducing skid and improving distance control and accuracy.   </p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Our putters also deliver immediate feedback on strike quality, giving players a clearer understanding of their stroke and helping them, truly, become better putters over time. Every Spoiler putter combines traditional aesthetics with innovative performance technology.</p><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">• What Makes Us Different:</h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Most putters focus solely on performance outcomes. Spoiler focuses on both<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>performance and improvement</strong>. Our patented technology promotes pure roll while providing feedback that helps golfers identify mishits and refine their stroke. We don't mask flaws—we reveal them. Golfers can literally see the difference in roll and feel the difference in impact, leading to greater confidence, fewer three-putts, and measurable improvement.</p><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">• How Affiliates Can Earn:</h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Affiliates earn commissions on every qualified sale generated through their unique referral links. With premium-priced products, strong customer satisfaction, and a passionate golf audience, affiliates have the opportunity to generate meaningful commissions while promoting a product they can genuinely believe in.</p><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">• How to Promote Us:</h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Spoiler performs best when affiliates focus on:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li>The visible difference in ball roll versus a traditional flat faced putter</li><li>The patented technology behind the putter</li><li>Helping golfers improve their putting, not just buying equipment and hoping it does</li><li>Product reviews, on-course demonstrations, and comparison content</li><li>Personal experiences and authentic storytelling</li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Video content, social media demonstrations, instructional content, and golfer testimonials are especially effective.</p><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">• Other Information:</h3><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li>Named Best Putter and Best Value Putter of 2025 by Rick Shiels and H.I.T. Golf. One of the original and largest YouTube Reviewers</li><li>Patented face technology engineered for purer, earlier forward roll</li><li>Our Lead Edge Roll design was inspired by putting with a wedge and understanding how pure the ball rolls off the face.  So we designed a radial face with 0 degrees of loft to create the same performance </li><li>Premium craftsmanship and traditional-inspired designs</li><li>Designed for golfers who value relative advantage, precision, feedback, and continuous improvement</li><li>Strong customer reviews highlighting confidence, consistency, and fewer three-putts</li><li>Dedicated affiliate support and marketing assets available</li><li>at 15% Commission, its ~$50/sale</li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Spoiler Golf Mission:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><em>Help golfers see the roll, feel the truth, and become better putters.</em></p></div></div>",
